          "explanation": "Converts launch text to numeric and snapshots distinct non-NULL work-unit/to-location/incoming-location triples for fixed work groups, instruction type and one fixed work type. Unordered loop upserts TRAV_PALLET by work unit only with local GETDATE timestamps. Unlike EX02, it does not set WORK_INSTRUCTION.USER_DEF1. Duplicate destinations for a unit can overwrite unpredictably. Session and process inputs unused.",
